1/24/allegheny-technologies-ati-q4-2017-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2018 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2018-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bob Wetherbee","x":"As a reminder, we requested a Section 232 tariff exception -- exclusion actually on behalf of the JV for a discrete amount of stainless slabs, 300,000 tons imported exclusively from Indonesia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2018 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2018-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bob Wetherbee","x":"Since our second quarter earnings call, there has been a significant change to the US government Section 232 tariff exclusion request process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2018 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2018-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Sims","x":"And what -- what price volatility we have in the marketplace we have mechanisms within the contracts, we have to pass those through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2018 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2018-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Timna Tanners","x":"I mean are you guiding to enough of a squeeze on your cost increases not being passed through to offset the -- even the tolling arrangements or are you just talking about reduced profitability on that end and then the tolling arrangements one would expect would continue to be an incremental…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2018 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2018-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rich Harshman","x":"The incremental leverage achieved on our topline growth demonstrates the scalability of our advanced manufacturing capabilities and the effectiveness of our prior business restructuring efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2018 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2018-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bob Wetherbee","x":"We've actually reduced our exposure significantly to commodity, Stainless over the last 12 months to 18 months as part of our restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2018-earnings-co.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2018 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2019-01-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bob Wetherbee","x":"In addition, our A&T Stainless joint venture was unable to fully overcome the negative impact of the Section 232 import tariffs while continuing to operate at approximately 40% of target volume.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/22/allegheny-technologies-ati-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2018 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2019-01-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bob Wetherbee","x":"We remain actively engaged at the highest levels of the U.S. Commerce Department in constructive dialogue around the facts of our tariff exclusion request and still firmly believe that our request offers a very compelling case for their approval.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/22/allegheny-technologies-ati-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2019-04-23","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Olin","x":"But I wanted to ask you about titanium sponge and this whole Section 232 investigation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2019-04-23","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Olin","x":"So I guess my question to you is, do you see any risk for import tariffs to be placed on your sponge purchases coming from Japan?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2019-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Wetherbee","x":"…by solid gains in the aerospace and defense markets in both segments, which were partly offset by declines in the FRP segment, specifically lower oil and gas market sales as compared to a very strong first quarter 2018 and lower raw material related surcharges being passed through to customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2019-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Wetherbee","x":"Additionally, segment margins were compressed due to the negative impact from the unprecedented rapid decline in raw material input prices, specifically for cobalt, but as a result, are not being fully passed through to our customers by our index pricing mechanism in the first half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2019-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"This cost savings action did not fully offset the lower demand and additional costs associated with our recent facility expansion, causing a short-term margin compression in this business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2019-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kimberly A. Fields","x":"As we've talked about in the past, the JV's imported slabs continue to be subject to the 25% Section 232 tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2019-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kimberly A. Fields","x":"So as Bob just said, our target is to get to that cash neutral position as we -- as we're in this period with the 232 and so we will continue to work with the partner to look for ways to minimize the impact from Section 232 until the tariffs aren't in place any longer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kimberly A. Fields","x":"We continue to work with our partner to achieve cash neutrality in the third -- in the fourth quarter despite the ongoing negative impact from Section 232 import tariffs through continued diligent cost controls.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2019-10-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kimberly A. Fields","x":"This is primarily due to the increased retirement benefit expenses and the ongoing impact of Section 232 tariffs on the A&T Stainless joint venture.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2020-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"This was despite the negative impacts from Section 232 tariffs, as well as elevated retirement benefit expense related to 2018's pension asset declines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2020-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kimberly A. Fields","x":"…the course of the year, the FRP teams worked hard to overcome the combination of the ongoing Section 232 tariffs on our A&T Stainless joint venture and carbon conversion volumes, and secondly, increased retirement benefit expenses and softer end market conditions for our standard value…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kimberly A. Fields","x":"We continue to aggressively manage our costs, including the full year 2020 benefit from our fourth quarter restructuring actions, to mitigate the impact of these ongoing challenges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2019 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Don P. Newman","x":"As we have talked about several times on this call, we finally -- we fully intend to maintain our cost and working capital discipline and will benefit from proactive efforts to improve earnings in 2019, including our fourth quarter restructuring action.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q4-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2020-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Don P. Newman","x":"Additionally, we've announced the indefinite idling of the A&T Stainless JVs Midland, Pennsylvania facility this summer due to the negative ongoing impact of Section 232 tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"More recently, we're actively adjusting staffing levels in our operations based on the specific needs of each business some through temporary or rolling idlings, some through indefinite furlough, some through layoff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"To streamline High Performance Materials & Components, or HPMC segment is made up of our Specialty Materials business located largely in the Carolinas, and our Advanced Forging business located primarily in Milwaukee, Wisconsin and Irvine, California.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"We've implemented permanent layoffs in operations where we expect a significant period of time before recovery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Don P. Newman","x":"We also recognized pre-tax charges for debt extinguishment for the partial redemption of our 2022 convertible notes and for further restructuring and severance actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q2-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2020-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Paretosh Misra","x":"Are you expecting any contribution from price increase also to your top line because maybe some new contracts starting with the new calendar year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"First, how we're taking control of what we can control, thus accelerating cost savings and strengthening our position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2020-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"We accelerated benefits from our cost savings initiatives through aggressive implementation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q3-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Wetherbee","x":"Importantly, we expect about $100 million of these cost savings to become structural, continuing to benefit ATI as we return to growth over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ATI 2020 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Wetherbee","x":"On Slide 5, you'll see two of the leading indicators we're using to track our progress toward this transformation: a streamline footprint and an improved product mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Paretosh Misra","x":"So I guess, more generally, in this segment, do you pass it through to your customers or hedge it?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"Since 2020, we've been laser-focused on streamlining our cost structures to improve our competitiveness and maintaining healthy cash balances to weather a storm of unpredictable duration.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"As we often discussed in 2020, our decremental margins benefited from our decisive and structural cost reduction actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/allegheny-technologies-inc-ati-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"Technology allowed us to streamline our processes and work more efficiently overall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/allegheny-technologies-incorporated-ati-q2-2021-ea/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"We'll continue to drive these improvements utilizing new skills and tools to provide more flexibility to our employees and create better connections with our customers, and we'll capture the associated structural cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/allegheny-technologies-incorporated-ati-q2-2021-ea/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"Our success is due in equal parts to accelerated rates of recovery in our diverse end markets, our significant business restructuring and transformation efforts and the perseverance of the ATI team.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/allegheny-technologies-incorporated-ati-q3-2021-ea/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2021-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert S. Wetherbee","x":"Kim's doing a great job aligning the businesses, accelerating execution and streamlining material flows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/allegheny-technologies-incorporated-ati-q3-2021-ea/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2022-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bob Wetherbee","x":"And almost all of our LTAs have significant material inflation pass-through and we're certainly doing that and then some in terms of the material pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/02/allegheny-technologies-ati-q4-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2022-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Paretosh Misra","x":"Is that a risk in the second half of this year or next year that that could be a revenue headwind, even though I realized that you pass those through to your customers?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/02/allegheny-technologies-ati-q4-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2022-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Don Newman","x":"On a reported basis, earnings per share was a loss of $0.23, reflecting on debt extinguishment charge and small restructuring adjustments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/02/allegheny-technologies-ati-q4-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2021 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2022-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Don Newman","x":"Mix improvements, structural cost savings, and raw material pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/02/allegheny-technologies-ati-q4-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2022 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2022-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Don Newman","x":"On the positive side of the ledger, we anticipate a $9 million benefit from our portion of the Section 232 tariff recovery made by our A&TS joint venture.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/allegheny-technologies-ati-q1-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2022 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bob Wetherbee","x":"We've raised prices to offset the additional raw material, labor, and supply chain costs we're experiencing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/allegheny-technologies-ati-q1-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2022 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Don Newman","x":"First of all, in terms of the pass-throughs, the way that you want to think about it for HPMC, we have long-term agreements that allow for the pass-through of a good portion of metal price movements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/allegheny-technologies-ati-q1-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2022 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2022-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Don Newman","x":"Given Q1 performance, Q2 outlook, and anticipated growth in the second half of the year, we're increasing our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/04/allegheny-technologies-ati-q1-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2022 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2022-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Don Newman","x":"Q2 2022 results included about $10 million of Section 232 recoveries on tariffs paid in prior periods.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/allegheny-technologies-ati-q2-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2022 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2022-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Don Newman","x":"And we don't anticipate additional federal employment incentives or Section 232 tariff recoveries in Q3.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/allegheny-technologies-ati-q2-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2022 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2022-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bob Wetherbee","x":"We're offsetting inflation with cost reduction initiatives and dynamic pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/allegheny-technologies-ati-q2-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2022 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2022-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Don Newman","x":"It also reflects their hard work streamlining cost structures, improving product mix, and fully offsetting the negative impact from inflation through midyear 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/allegheny-technologies-ati-q2-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"ATI 2025 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2025-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"There's mechanisms for pass-through for metal, inflation, tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ati-ati-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2025 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2025-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"Today, we are structurally stronger, anchored in differentiated materials, long-term customer relationships and sustainable pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ati-ati-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2025 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2025-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"Given this performance and our outlook for Q4, we are raising our full year guidance across the board.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ati-ati-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2025 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2025-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Donald Newman","x":"Building on Kim's comments, we are raising full-year guidance to reflect stronger performance and visibility through year-end.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/ati-ati-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2025 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2026-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Donald Newman","x":"In the second half, price increases under LTAs will lift sales, profits, and margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/ati-ati-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2025 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2026-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Donald Newman","x":"Building out the model a bit further, plan for consolidated incremental margins for the full year to average 40%, with second-half 2026 margins above 40% due to LTA price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/ati-ati-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2025 Q4","e":"ati","d":"2026-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"Incremental operational improvements are already underway, and we see tangible opportunities to streamline processes, reduce costs, and expand margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/ati-ati-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Myles Walton","x":"And Rob, can you just remind us of your tariff outlook for '26 after the changes with IEEPA and 232, where we are positive, negative?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/ati-ati-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"So yes, for tariffs, we've kept -- right now, we're status quo.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/ati-ati-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Foster","x":"In the second half, sales, profits and margins will be lifted by price increases and mix under LTAs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/ati-ati-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"So any tariffs that we're still experiencing, we're passing those through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/ati-ati-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"Across ATI, we are improving throughput, increasing yields and streamlining production flow, particularly in melting, forging and downstream processing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/ati-ati-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Foster","x":"As Kim mentioned, we're increasing our full year guidance across all key financial metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/ati-ati-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q1","e":"ati","d":"2026-04-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"With strong core market demand and record backlog, we are confident in our increased full year outlook. $5 billion of revenue at 20%-plus margins is in clear sight with an increasing share converting into earnings and free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/ati-ati-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kimberly Fields","x":"One is the work we're doing through Elevation and the improvements around productivity and taking cost out of our operation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/ati-ati-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Foster","x":"We are raising our full year outlook across every key financial measure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/ati-ati-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q2","e":"ati","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James Foster","x":"Our increased outlook is supported by contracted pricing, a record backlog, committed customer schedules and planned shipment timing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/ati-ati-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Kim Fields","x":"ATI delivered another strong quarter, and we have raised our full-year outlook for the third time this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/ati-ati-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ATI 2026 Q3","e":"ati","d":"2026-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Kim Fields","x":"We raised our full-year outlook for the third time this year, and we expect an even stronger fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/ati-ati-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[32,1,8378,0,0,0,7028,905],[35,1,10588,0,0,0,7622,2406],[36,1,10260,0,0,0,8177,1515],[37,1,9259,0,0,0,7701,1080],[38,1,9581,0,0,0,7585,1506],[39,1,9277,0,0,0,7367,1374],[40,1,8464,0,0,0,7244,784],[41,1,9064,0,0,0,8207,521],[42,1,8638,0,0,0,7006,1219],[43,1,8995,0,0,0,7266,1340],[44,1,9200,0,0,0,7472,1396],[45,1,7448,0,0,0,6577,581],[46,1,8445,0,0,0,6962,1101],[47,1,9158,0,0,0,7289,1434],[48,1,9385,0,0,0,8095,934],[49,1,8627,0,0,0,7589,728],[50,1,8966,0,0,0,7605,1044],[63,1,6794,0,0,0,5794,796],[64,1,7394,0,0,0,6047,1015],[65,1,8093,0,0,0,1536,6176],[66,1,6243,0,0,0,1812,4182],[67,1,7180,0,0,0,1949,4753]],"cinema":[[32,1,8378,0,0,0,7028,905],[35,1,10588,0,0,0,7622,2406],[36,1,10260,0,0,0,8177,1515],[37,1,9259,0,0,0,7701,1080],[38,1,9581,0,0,0,7585,1506],[39,1,9277,0,0,0,7367,1374],[40,1,8464,0,0,0,7244,784],[41,1,9064,0,0,0,8207,521],[42,1,8638,0,0,0,7006,1219],[43,1,8995,0,0,0,7266,1340],[44,1,9200,0,0,0,7472,1396],[45,1,7448,0,0,0,6577,581],[46,1,8445,0,0,0,6962,1101],[47,1,9158,0,0,0,7289,1434],[48,1,9385,0,0,0,8095,934],[49,1,8627,0,0,0,7589,728],[50,1,8966,0,0,0,7605,1044],[63,1,6794,0,0,0,5794,796],[64,1,7394,0,0,0,6047,1015],[65,1,8093,0,0,0,1536,6176],[66,1,6243,0,0,0,1812,4182],[67,1,7180,0,0,0,1949,4753]],"imax":[[32,1,8378,0,0,0,7028,905],[35,1,10588,0,0,0,7622,2406],[36,1,10260,0,0,0,8177,1515],[37,1,9259,0,0,0,7701,1080],[38,1,9581,0,0,0,7585,1506],[39,1,9277,0,0,0,7367,1374],[40,1,8464,0,0,0,7244,784],[41,1,9064,0,0,0,8207,521],[42,1,8638,0,0,0,7006,1219],[43,1,8995,0,0,0,7266,1340],[44,1,9200,0,0,0,7472,1396],[45,1,7448,0,0,0,6577,581],[46,1,8445,0,0,0,6962,1101],[47,1,9158,0,0,0,7289,1434],[48,1,9385,0,0,0,8095,934],[49,1,8627,0,0,0,7589,728],[50,1,8966,0,0,0,7605,1044],[63,1,6794,0,0,0,5794,796],[64,1,7394,0,0,0,6047,1015],[65,1,8093,0,0,0,1536,6176],[66,1,6243,0,0,0,1812,4182],[67,1,7180,0,0,0,1949,4753